        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Rocky/scene_dugong.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b0848f7d-adfe-4410-a34c-00d5e9197c31).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, \ryour next assignment takes you to the Andaman Sea. \rOur client is one Taita from Columbia. The targets are five of his clients who ordered something to help with their insomnia.\rHe sent them some of his special powder but they were not satisfied with the results.\rNow they are threatening to expose him as a fraud, and he can&apos;t risk getting investigated because he is helping the cartel.\r\rThey wanted to sleep better, so make sure they don&apos;t wake up ever again.\r\rGood hunting.",
